# F6: vec3 is `pub type`, and still only module vec may build it or take it
# apart positionally. `kanso check probes/f6_foreign_record` answers
#   error[opacity]: `vec/vec3` is foreign — its structure does not cross ...
# and with the destructuring line deleted,
#   error[opacity]: `vec/vec3` is foreign — only `vec` builds a `vec3`; ...
# Dot reads (`v.y`) and keyed reads (`{ x } = v`) are accepted.
import "../../vec"

v = vec/vec3 1.0 2.0 3.0
vec/vec3 a b c = v
{ x } = v
print "{a} {b} {c} {x} {v.y}"
